{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40501","headline":"颂鲁 · 苏拯","name":"颂鲁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天推鲁仲尼，周游布典坟。\n游遍七十国，不令遇一君。\n一国如一遇，单车不转轮。\n良由至化力，爲国不爲身。\n礼乐行未足，邅回厄於陈。\n礼乐今有余，衮旒当圣人。\n伤哉绝粮议，千载误云云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}